#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:5 bc4d120a5c8d49dcbad4facd495e3df8
msgid "GSoC - Google Summer of Code"
msgstr "GSoC - 谷歌代码之夏"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:6 00c8168078354de1859161a099126e00
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Each year, ArduPilot participates in the `Google Summer of Code program "
"<https://summerofcode.withgoogle.com/>`__, encouraging students and "
"others to contribute to the ArduPilot codebase."
msgstr ""
"每年，ArduPilot 都会参与 `谷歌代码之夏项目 "
"<https://summerofcode.withgoogle.com/>`__，鼓励学生和其他人向 ArduPilot 代码库贡献。"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:8 c4dbc853d2304ae1a07dd6f6e77ae2a1
msgid ""
"The development team includes experienced mentors who will help students "
"make great contributions to ArduPilot."
msgstr "开发团队包含经验丰富的导师，将帮助学生为 ArduPilot 做出出色的贡献。"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:10 9180d063d18a4cfa8cede2b9791ef185
msgid "To help you get started:"
msgstr "帮助您入门的资源："

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:12 42093dc8569644779ba0cb8002f3a9c8
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The `timeline for GSoC 2026 is here <https://developers.google.com/open-"
"source/gsoc/timeline>`__"
msgstr ""
"`GSoC 2025 的时间表在此 <https://developers.google.com/open-"
"source/gsoc/timeline>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:13 8b2ff0eebe1d45489cfc07ab18ce21d5
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The :ref:`suggested projects list and previous year GSoC projects <gsoc-"
"ideas-list>` is here. This is a list of our ideas of what would be good "
"to work on, but we are open to other suggestions you make in your "
"application."
msgstr ":ref:`建议项目列表在此 <gsoc-ideas-list>`。这是我们认为值得开展的项目创意列表，但我们也欢迎您在申请中提出其他建议。"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:15 c015913031b0485981f17afc683172b7
msgid ""
"The purpose of GSoC is to help people become long-term contributors. We "
"want people to stay in the community after the term."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:17 bc90e1367d1541eda301bdaa6c5347ed
msgid ""
"The #GSOC channel in the `ArduPilot Discord server "
"<https://ardupilot.org/discord>`__ is a good place to ask questions about"
" our GSOC program, submit ideas for projects, etc. Mentors will respond "
"to your posts in this GSoC channel."
msgstr ""
"`ArduPilot Discord 服务器 <https://ardupilot.org/discord>`__ 中的 #GSOC 频道是询问 "
"GSoC 项目问题、提交项目创意等的好地方。导师将在该 GSoC 频道中回复您的帖子。"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:18 0382ef9889af42fd973ec35e48d1b5e6
msgid ""
"The :ref:`ArduPilot Wiki <ardupilot:home>` and, specifically, the "
":ref:`ArduPilot Developers Wiki <dev:home>` are good sources of "
"information on ArduPilot and how to contribute to its code."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ArduPilot Wiki <ardupilot:home>`，尤其是 :ref:`ArduPilot 开发者 Wiki "
"<dev:home>`，是了解 ArduPilot 及如何贡献代码的良好信息来源。"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:19 e097c24c301044a9aa46949cd78c25ba
msgid ""
"The `ArduPilot Discuss Forum GSoC category "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/c/google-summer-of-code/131>`__ is for "
"GSoC topics and should be cross-posted to the #GSoC Discord channel."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:20 bce50a8c5a6c4841b5643a6d6dbe7185
msgid "Check out the `Blog <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/c/blog>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc.rst:21 b5203737583144bf8e733fcfc136b5f7
msgid ""
"Past conference talks are on the `ArduPilot YouTube channel "
"<https://www.youtube.com/@ardupilot19/playlists>`__."
msgstr ""

